msgid "⟪k:0⟫(What could this feeling be, I wonder?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It’s not quite foreboding...)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫(Je me demande bien ce que je ressens...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ce n’est pas vraiment un pressentiment...)"

#: scenario:scenario_EC2E5E21_2713_47FA_833C_90F538C46B85
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 685bbf68414df8773b18521c521e16c1141691e259c13caa2ef46d6a4e875daf
