#: scenario:scenario_666D8E7B_F0D9_49F6_8DD7_BE30ACD02278
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3f0b78152ead8e22011a3d2b495b6cff095415e7b0aec9c9be559df4590f0c00
#. default-sha256: 7f62f13ed22e109256f4f3425d8805c2f1a8cd57ea2301167f784a7183c9ffa0
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_666D8E7B_F0D9_49F6_8DD7_BE30ACD02278"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫The "
"only sounds that could be heard in the dark corridors were the sharp pitter-patter of the rain, "
"his footsteps, and his breathing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Les "
"seuls bruits que l’on pouvait entendre dans les obscurs couloirs du manoir étaient le lourd ploc-"
"ploc de la pluie, les pas de Mell et sa respiration."

#: scenario:scenario_3E02E646_1ECF_4E68_A46C_A4416474A5CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bfdef84bd917781e07a26e8dcea47b9152adee8ae7f3c84aa5cb3080c1d2ff16
#. default-sha256: 325d9562d1e2915ef140e21e095af6ecd0be637f98c54212a6af48a94b586d49
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3E02E646_1ECF_4E68_A46C_A4416474A5CD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though he was intimately familiar with the layout of the house, that night, the hallways "
"felt like an endless labyrinth veiled in shadows."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Même s’il connaissait bien la maison, il avait l’impression cette nuit-là que les couloirs "
"étaient des labyrinthes interminables qui se drapaient dans les ténèbres."

#: scenario:scenario_E2DD2A30_D607_470F_A060_BC5B1E78EC2C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e30e8d0707cf32797d812e4d9e63c8467f4eaa64f9e0a3c5e6437953cb066559
#. default-sha256: 09fcae59b1899bf59272576644dd82a0f24a0514b008b40d9aece3fb7f6aaccb
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E2DD2A30_D607_470F_A060_BC5B1E78EC2C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No moonlight shone through the windows, so he naturally found himself moving cautiously, "
"despite being in his own residence."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’était une nuit sans lune, il se retrouva donc tout naturellement à se déplacer avec "
"prudence, même si c’était sa propre résidence."

#: scenario:scenario_75F434A0_B751_460F_A1DC_1D339A07B2A2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0fdecb18e82523cb2c0e0c68d8123fed8ff559eb50d76ccfbfe15c2bbf734d45
#. default-sha256: 47a7ad1b95da6e7c6393bb49238dbe989231eb0d5e5a1a0d98636de20b3d8afd
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_75F434A0_B751_460F_A1DC_1D339A07B2A2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Keeping the palm of his hand pressed up against the chilly wall, he put one foot in front of "
"the other."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il gardait sa main pressée contre le mur glacial et il posait lentement un pied devant "
"l’autre."

#: scenario:scenario_2FC7DC57_B9A8_43A5_98C4_9F19FFEE95A5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 03345a9b06e0400368b6cd85c51b91dc30ab228f2cf6f8385af34a8b737a5898
#. default-sha256: b7b6f4e09a82916137d5ae08c94ae109a7f04d34ea0faac2810f1db87290b4fa
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2FC7DC57_B9A8_43A5_98C4_9F19FFEE95A5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But to where was he supposed to head?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mell, of course, had no way of answering that "
"question himself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais où était-il censé aller ?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Bien entendu, Mell n’avait aucun moyen de répondre à "
"cette question."

#: scenario:scenario_EB4A4C67_7CE2_42EA_9CCB_3459BDF23D1D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3da16c661ca1152b26d298e3d319f6e31eb39066c1a7a1b5289d2cd6ccb1e4c5
#. default-sha256: a16e90acd8ed6909292d690ca760b07a000083647315f612347549c1c6359bed
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_EB4A4C67_7CE2_42EA_9CCB_3459BDF23D1D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If he had anything... ⟪k:1⟫it was guidance from above—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫the path to his destination "
"lit by flashes of lightning."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫S’il avait un guide... ⟪k:1⟫il lui venait d’en haut—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫le chemin vers son destin "
"était illuminé par les éclairs."

#: scenario:scenario_815C4AA0_5DB1_406F_82A1_1EFD1D08404F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0a582f0949e6f41780281d83469da2f9e15dad894e22cef4e76f64d1749a8da9
#. default-sha256: 440ef41275e3ea900774b5bdede4d0ee1b8237b667c9e06b6ea60f7ee973aaa9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_815C4AA0_5DB1_406F_82A1_1EFD1D08404F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Or perhaps there was something else leading him along."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ou peut-être était-ce autre chose qui le guidait tout du long."

#: scenario:scenario_3A75F580_A5E3_48EC_AA57_2BFAE51E1CEB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 227b5ece8d5827c22f4f6aa999f5b57c681e5e8b05648c792ea0d68e77e3009d
#. default-sha256: e3016219c680e20a69b45432d323901da38ef32b282ff67bc7ee02434dbb8d02
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3A75F580_A5E3_48EC_AA57_2BFAE51E1CEB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though he progressed with a fair bit of hesitation in his step, Mell was slowly but surely "
"drawing nearer to one room in particular."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il avait beau avancer en tâtonnant, il se rapprochait lentement mais sûrement d’une pièce en "
"particulier."

#: scenario:scenario_F42B0957_BF80_4AD8_A18B_938E16BEEA60
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e261f9202086730a9bee90abc587764e03d4a1fc8668873d9e672bc453f7022f
