#: scenario:scenario_2AE20ED4_E099_41F6_8905_7F49DC83EDBF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 52b8032bf466539cb595627f8e93ca900b02090c79673473ce579bb75bedf394
