msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2AE20ED4_E099_41F6_8905_7F49DC83EDBF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She had glasslike skin, eyes that glimmered in the flickering candlelight, and snow-white "
"hair that flowed like luxurious silk."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elle avait la peau comme du verre, des yeux qui brillaient à la lueur tremblotante des "
"chandelles, et des cheveux d’un blanc neige qui ondulaient comme de la soie."

#: scenario:scenario_9A5DA03F_23A6_47D4_9766_AE2EE423F89C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 62651ff8baacf2bdddc187e6c2857a6d8a58a46f620734b12c42e672311e3876
#. default-sha256: e19f9cc393f1253098831a7aa506a110ad1fb525ef06d9045d3cfd6c0d340f33
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_9A5DA03F_23A6_47D4_9766_AE2EE423F89C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But her lips were bluish-purple; her soft, delicate skin sullied with grime; her twinkling "
"eyes pointed down at the floor; and her hair a disheveled mess."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais ses lèvres étaient bleuâtres, presque violettes ; sa peau douce et délicate, souillée "
"par la crasse ; ses yeux pétillants étaient baissés ; et ses cheveux étaient en bataille."

#: scenario:scenario_7ECAFE70_D1A3_42A5_96B6_6E8AE01D54AA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d631e3c1adddd79f6b02e52ff244edbd34db90600e2ff769a96822448fd048e2
